<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-18T01:17:04.847Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:17:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Maduro and his wife pleaded not guilty to U.S. conspiracy to torture charges. The United States lifted sanctions on Jorge Rodríguez and deployed Space Force electromagnetic and electronic warfare systems against Venezuela, echoing similar actions in Iran. A soldier who bet $400,000 on Maduro's removal made his first court appearance and was arrested by U.S. authorities. The United States may be forced to release the legal justification for recent boat strikes on drug traffickers. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPSm53RDlpSVFXRjkzV1pJTkIyYlRzeFptSU1ManNGYXJnRFdmNFo2OGFOdjVxQU9UcDNmbllWMzFmbmJNV2tEc1UwQy1rWU5CYmJURnZkaUF1c1Y4UXAzV2JZNmdPdnhYcENsYmh0bXRJLTBTNFNGWUl4QjZKOHJ3QzhuZmtvcWplbGN3OVVaQXNmdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Siasat Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNSUxTMV9UODNBbW